/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Wake up early in the morning and post breakfast, check out from the hotel and drive towards Kasol from Manali. Enroute Kasol, you can indulge in adventure activities like paragliding and river rafting at Kullu \(by your own\). After arriving in Kasol, check-in to our hotel/campsite & freshen- up. Post refreshment, we will head out to explore the streets of Kasol, visit Chalal bridge and chill along Parvati riverside. Soak in the hippie vibes of Kasol, go for cafe hopping and treat your stomach with mouth-watering local dishes. Savour home- style cooked dinner and overnight stay in a hotel/campsite in Kasol.)
/E (Wake up early in the morning and post breakfast, check out from the hotel and drive towards Kasol from Manali. Enroute Kasol, you can indulge in adventure activities like paragliding and river rafting at Kullu \(by your own\). After arriving in Kasol, check-in to our hotel/campsite & freshen- up. Post refreshment, we will head out to explore the streets of Kasol, visit Chalal bridge and chill along Parvati riverside. Soak in the hippie vibes of Kasol, go for cafe hopping and treat your stomach with mouth-watering local dishes. Savour home- style cooked dinner and overnight stay in a hotel/campsite in Kasol.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
